{"articleNo":"1777","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1777&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Xilinx FPGA 설계 인증과정 교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.05.23","hit":"9059","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">Xilinx FPGA 설계 인증과정 교육생 모집</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">(2011년도 하계)</span> <br><br>&nbsp; </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 목&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 적 : 디지털 하드웨어 설계 분야의 실무 중심 교육을 통해 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">Xilinx 공인</span> <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">인증서 및 교육과정 수료증을 발급</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">함으로써 취업 역량을 강화하기 위함</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 주관부서 :&nbsp;금오공대 디지털산업교육센터</span>&nbsp; </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 교육장소 : 금오공대 디지털관 435호</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">4. 교육기간 :&nbsp; 2011년 6월 20일(월) ~ 6월 27일(월)&nbsp;(6일, 42시간)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 교육내용 : HDL(Verilog 또는 VHDL)와 FPGA를 이용한 디지털회로 설계 및 검증 2차과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 지원자격 : 전자공학부 소속 3학년 또는 4학년 학부생</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① “ASIC 설계 및 실습”, “VHDL 설계 및 실습” 교과목 이수자,&nbsp;</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②&nbsp; Verilog HDL 또는 VHDL에 관한 사전 지식이 있는 자</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">7. 선발기준 : 관련 교과목(ASIC설계및실습, VHDL설계및실습) 이수자중</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 성적 우수자 순으로 선발 예정.</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">8. 모집인원 : 20명</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">9. 참가 신청서 : 전자공학부 홈페이지 또는&nbsp;차세대</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">반도체</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 홈페이지</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><a href=\"http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)에서 다운로드</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">10. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011년 5월 23일(월) ~ 6월 3일(목) 오후 5시</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제출처 : 디지털관 학사행정실 제출</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">11. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교육 대상자 발표 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 2011년 6월 7일 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">전자공학부 홈페이지, 차세대</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">반도체</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 홈페이지</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ( </span><a href=\"http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">12. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교육생 특전</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 인증시험 통과자에게 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">Xilinx Training Center의 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">공인 인증서</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 수여</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 교육과정 수료자에게 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수료증 수여</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 교육비 무료, 교재 제공 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">13. 문의 : 전자공학부 사무실 (054-478-7450)</span> </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
